{"3803270":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"RhythmStrike","steam_appid":3803270,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RhythmStrike is a vertical-scrolling rhythm game inspired by modern Japanese arcade titles. Play songs from renowned rhythm game artists such as t+pazolite, LeaF, and EBIMAYO using hybrid keyboard and mouse controls.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[ GAMEPLAY ]<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap incoming notes with your keyboard while moving your mouse. Master hybrid charts that shift between standard 6K and 3K+Mouse sections. As you play, visual effects trigger in sync with the track, altering the visuals in real time. The entire game is designed for maximum fun without requiring any special controllers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3803270\/extras\/f7a02e93e6dfd8e877f3a0e170cc955f.poster.avif?t=1793720677\" aria-label=\"Gameplay footage. It shows how the notes move across the play field and the switch between keyboard and mouse sections.\" width=748 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3803270\/extras\/f7a02e93e6dfd8e877f3a0e170cc955f.webm?t=1793720677\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3803270\/extras\/f7a02e93e6dfd8e877f3a0e170cc955f.mp4?t=1793720677\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[ MISSION MODE ]<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on a special challenge campaign. Clear songs by surviving miss limits, hitting combo thresholds, or maintaining precise accuracy to unlock bonus content.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla